{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1525250-v5-blood-stained-love-and-bleed","id":1525250,"title":"V5 Blood-Stained Love and Bleed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-11-09T08:59:52-08:00","id":1525250,"title":"V5 Blood-Stained Love and Bleed","content":"As we all know, the next V5 supplement is going to focus on vampire romance. Over the last couple of weeks (like with other Renegade supplements) we've been getting previews of some selected double-pages. The previews thus far ranged from okay to tacky and cringe-worthy. Personally I cringed the most at the idea that one way to introduce romantic drama is that an Anarch domain established a rule that vampire romance <i>has to</i> happen between three vampires or more. The reason: The ruling Anarchs believe that romance between two vampires is a &quot;Camarilla holdover&quot; (that's what the book calls it).<br /> <br /> But the latest preview is different from what can be seen on those two pages. From the section &quot;Advice On Considerate Play&quot; in the V5 corebook to the section in the V5 Players Guide that calls out in a sidebar &quot;Mind the Bleed!&quot; a cautious tone is established. What is worrying is that Blood-Stained Love has a different take on that subject: &quot;You know what? Scratch that. Actually, Bleed is fun!&quot;<br /> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"1509\" height=\"950\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Inx92sJ.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Inx92sJ.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Inx92sJ.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> The tone is very upbeat and optimistic rather than cautious. And the sidebar gives some advice where the pro-Bleed-section should come with far more detailed explanations and the anti-Bleed-advice is just strange. The only two modes of roleplaying expressed here are either going full steam ahead in embracing Bleed or playing some too-cool-for-school asshole if you don't want that. That's a black-and-white-distinction that deserves far more nuance.<br /> <br /> Additionally, I can't help but notice how LARP is mentioned there. This book is mainly targeted at audiences looking to play the game around a table. You can't just casually export LARP-ideas/experiences and apply them to the different setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T15:19:07-08:00","id":1525274,"title":"","content":"Jacqueline Bryk - who wrote the V5 considerate play stuff for V5 and V5 Players Guide - has been pretty active on social media explaining the problems with this preview in detail considering how much it goes against the very things she was hired to write for V5 previously.<br /> <br /> For those not following this closely, Paradox/Renegade have promised that there's three more pages on Bleed after these two that are supposed to address the concerns people have and those will be added to the previews next. Though even if the rest of the section does accomplish this, I can't imagine how without massive tonal whiplash.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T16:27:18-08:00","id":1525277,"title":"","content":"Okay, so there are three more pages... why are they coming out next week...? Presumably, it's just taking stuff from a ready-for-release-pdf and putting it on the Renegade-web-store...<br /> <br /> Also, I have my doubts that those pages will make a difference. If they cared, these two pages wouldn't have shown up in isolation to begin with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T17:40:11-08:00","id":1525278,"title":"","content":"As seems to be usual, they didn't think through releasing things in parts. Whether the totality is good or bad, they seem very blind to how things look in snippets no matter how many times it bites them in the PR butt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T20:42:22-08:00","id":1525285,"title":"","content":"i should say Blood Stained Love is written by Renegade Game Studios and it was not written in house by Paradox. the two previous v5 books were written by in house by paradox, now the team's changed.<br /> I suspect Those section was probably written by someone inexperienced with the concept of Bleed as whole,and they ended up making a mistake","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-10T01:26:11-08:00","id":1525298,"title":"","content":"Everything Renegade makes still needs approval from Paradox before going to press. Considering there are some fairly prominent Nordic LARP folks also angry about how the preview name checks their style of play while getting it so wrong, you'd think Paradox would be a bit more likely to catch something like that and ask for a re-edit.<br /> <br /> Considering the strong hand we know Paradox has taken with some out-of-house books in the past, their hands aren't clean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-10T01:27:41-08:00","id":1525299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1525250-v5-blood-stained-love-and-bleed?p=1525285#post1525285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i should say Blood Stained Love is written by Renegade Game Studios and it was not written in house by Paradox. the two previous v5 books were written by in house by paradox, now the team's changed.<br /> I suspect Those section was probably written by someone inexperienced with the concept of Bleed as whole,and they ended up making a mistake</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you think that anything they write and place online is not approved by Paradox?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-10T02:35:05-08:00","id":1525301,"title":"","content":"If I had to guess who's responsible for this section and bringing this Nordic LARP concept into V5, I'd be looking at the Renegade Games WOD lead-developer Juhana Pettersson. He also has a background in LARPs (here he gives <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hiCMZqkLvBw\" target=\"_blank\">a talk at the Copenhagen Nordic LARP Talks 2023</a>), so it can't be inexperience that led to this. And having thought about it, what might have gone wrong here is that this section aims to be a sales-pitch of a specific Nordic LARP concept to the general roleplaying audience. But by focusing on trying to sell you on the idea of Bleed-hunting, a lot of the nuance has gotten lost. Although even with that generous reading, the sidebar still looks really bad, I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-10T05:35:49-08:00","id":1525305,"title":"","content":"Oh, ok then","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-10T21:31:14-08:00","id":1525338,"title":"","content":"Just remember. We are getting this shit instead of another city by night book or any V5 clanbooks or any updates to what the beckoning and gehenna war actually entails.<br /> <br /> Way to go Paradox!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5617-vendrin","name":"Vendrin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5617_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-14T11:30:37-08:00","id":1525429,"title":"","content":"Edit: Sorry, wrong thread lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27535,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","user":"Knightingale","date":". 11-14-2023, 02:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-15T01:48:26-08:00","id":1525444,"title":"","content":"I mean romance and how to incorporate it as a plot point is a great idea for a supplement. But after Renegade's previous two books, I have NO faith in them pulling this off.<br /> <br /> I'm terrible, because I don't think anyone but OP does it right.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/uWWwKDttHnM\" data-code=\"uWWwKDttHnM\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/uWWwKDttHnM/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-15T02:22:46-08:00","id":1525446,"title":"","content":"Today we're gonna get those three other pages together with the regular preview. It's a bit weird that those three pages couldn't have been released earlier but well, it is what it is.<br /> <br /> Looking at the online-discourse one thing becomes clear: Both Bleed and how to handle Bleed in a game aren't universally agreed upon matters. And you have some stark differences in how people react to the idea. Some have some very negative associations with Bleed and see it as a thing to avoid rather than to encourage and then I've seen the take of &quot;Bleed is neutral.&quot; and with the right tools and safety-precautions it can enhance the roleplaying experience. But reading about the latter and what Nordic LARP considers &quot;Bleed-hunting&quot;, I'm not sure it's something that's as easy to sell as the text from the book makes it seem. Because to me at least, the way it's described we're starting to no longer talk about a gaming-experience that involves roleplaying but instead deal with acting-techniques to enhance a performance. You go from playing a character in a game to playing a role.<br /> <br /> And with that in mind, the sidebar also makes more sense because once we look at it as actors in roles, then the identity of the actor matters since obviously while looking at a movie, you wouldn't say every actor can play every role in that movie and some actors because of who they are and what their individual acting-style is are more suited for one role than another. And figuring out what roles an actor is good at and suitable for is of course a whole process.<br /> <br /> But I don't think I've ever been that involved in roleplaying a character or played with someone who did that. When Bleed came up it was more interpersonal drama-related stuff or someone getting too passionate about an in-game situation outside the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T22:10:48-08:00","id":1526964,"title":"","content":"I am very annoyed by this book.<br /> <br /> Because I returned my Planescape 5th Edition books to Amazon to buy this instead and found out that unlike ALL THE OTHER preorders I've done from Renegade, I don't get the PDF early.<br /> <br /> Which is BS as I really wanted to read this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T22:12:18-08:00","id":1526965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> O