<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-17T14:06:30-08:00","id":1527000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1525250-v5-blood-stained-love-and-bleed?p=1526964#post1526964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am very annoyed by this book.<br /> <br /> Because I returned my Planescape 5th Edition books to Amazon to buy this instead and found out that unlike ALL THE OTHER preorders I've done from Renegade, I don't get the PDF early.<br /> <br /> Which is BS as I really wanted to read this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, I was wondering about the same thing... Normally there would be these early-release-pre-order pdfs for something like Blood-Stained Love. And for Blood Sigils they still released the pdf despite not having the physical release ready. There wasn't an announcement, though, that this has changed right? But I guess their distribution really did take a hit then. I mean, at the beginning of 2023 their stated goal had been to release both Blood Stained Love and H5 Alma Maters at this point in physical form. Of course, that hasn't happened. And instead, the website right now says multiple releases are coming in Q1. (Also, the last time I checked I think Crimson Gutter had used to be a February release)<br /> <br /> The release-schedule right now is:<ul><li>January: Blood Stained Love</li> <li>March: Crimson Gutter</li> <li>April: W5 Scent of Decay/H5 Alma Maters</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-04T11:45:24-08:00","id":1527940,"title":"","content":"Some news on the Blood-Stained Love book: <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"985\" height=\"827\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMOOik6.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMOOik6.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMOOik6.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> It's better than not doing anything, I guess, but... still baffled by the idea of them not realizing what it would mean to drop &quot;Hey, guys, when it comes to romance-play: Have you ever heard of something called 'Bleed-Hunting'? You should try it! It's fun!&quot; on the general TTRPG-community...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count"